<header class="page-hero">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="eyebrow"><b aria-hidden="true">●</b> Agent Smith for <b>Azure DevOps</b></div>
    <h1><span class="ln"><span class="w1">Azure Boards in.</span></span><span class="ln"><span><span class="out">Azure Repos</span> <span class="w3">out.</span></span></span></h1>
    <p class="lede">Agent Smith picks up a work item from Azure Boards, clones your Azure Repos into a sandbox, writes the change, runs your tests, and opens the pull request in Azure Repos. Then it moves the work item to the state you called done.</p>
    <p class="lede">No GitHub mirror in between. It runs in your own estate and calls the model you already pay for.</p>
    <div class="cta-row">
      <a href="{{ site.docsUrl }}/connect-your-stuff/tracker-azure-devops/" class="btn btn-go">Wire up Azure DevOps</a>
